THOUGHT: The checks confirm that the application must provide shared durable state across independently addressed nodes, so I’ll now create the core service with SQLite-backed authentication, workspaces, channels, messages, reactions, pins, read state, durable per-channel events, WebSocket subscribe/resume, and a supervised three-node launcher. This establishes the runnable foundation before iterative endpoint testing.

